WEBVTT

00:07:58.956 --> 00:08:00.116
So what did we do?

00:08:00.156 --> 00:08:02.716
Well, first of all,
we gave ourselves a team name --

00:08:02.756 --> 00:08:04.916
it's called the Cassava Virus
Action Project.

00:08:04.956 --> 00:08:06.316
We made a website,

00:08:06.316 --> 00:08:09.956
we gathered support from the genomics
and computing communities,

00:08:09.956 --> 00:08:11.836
and away we went to the farmers.

00:08:12.396 --> 00:08:15.236
Everything that we need for our Tree Lab

00:08:15.236 --> 00:08:17.636
is being carried by the team here.

00:08:17.676 --> 00:08:21.716
All of the molecular and computational
requirements needed

00:08:21.756 --> 00:08:25.036
to diagnose sick plants is there.

00:08:25.436 --> 00:08:28.236
And it's actually all
on this stage here as well.

00:08:29.156 --> 00:08:32.756
We figured if we could get the data
closer to the problem,